/* CHIH (native/dev/chihiro.c): a Chihiro's baseboard and media board. A
 * byte, whether the state is of a Chihiro; then the QC and SC boards (each
 * an AN2131 running its 8051 firmware, their EEPROMs and SRAM, the QC's JVS
 * board), the drive boards, the CRP-1231 card reader and the media board's
 * registers and mailboxes. Their USB side is in USB. The fields are xemu's
 * (hw/xbox/chihiro/chihiro-usb.c's vmstate), the structs xemu's too; every
 * pointer and callback is set again on load (an2131_relink). The DIMM's
 * system area is not here: battery-backed, a load doesn't roll it back. */
NC_SECTION(CHIH)

